From c87f609d3733f7eb57e5804e8a7cb3810fdd0a22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeffy Chen <jeffy.chen@rock-chips.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Nov 2021 11:14:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 19/41] waylandsink: Support NV12_10LE40 NV16_10LE40 and
 NV12|NV12_10LE40|NV16 (AFBC)

Tested on RK356x with:
export GST_MPP_VIDEODEC_DEFAULT_ARM_AFBC=1
gst-play-1.0 video.mp4 --videosink=waylandsink

Signed-off-by: Jeffy Chen <jeffy.chen@rock-chips.com>
---
